#: ../../../reference/interfaces/remoteproc-interface.md:2
msgid "remoteproc interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/remoteproc-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `remoteproc` interface enables developers to interact with the [Remote "
"Processor Framework](https://docs.kernel.org/staging/remoteproc.html) of the "
"Linux kernel, typically allowing them to upload firmware to a SoC embedded "
"microcontroller."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/remoteproc-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"Modern ARM-based silicon contain have additional Cortex M4 or M7 based "
"microcontrollers within the SoC."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/remoteproc-interface.md:8
msgid ""
"This interface allows a snap to load a firmware to such microcontrollers via "
"a snap, and permits the microcontroller to be started and stopped."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/remoteproc-interface.md:10
msgid "Requires snapd version _2.62+_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/remoteproc-interface.md:14
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/remoteproc-interface.md:16
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`** : "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`** : yes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/remoteproc-interface.md:16
